+`regionId` identifies the Canvas region represented by the tree's draft
+geometry markers. It defaults to `content`; pass a PageRegion machine name when
+rendering a global region:
+
+```tsx
+<CanvasComponentTree
+  tree={regions.pre_header}
+  components={components}
+  regionId="pre_header"
+/>;
+```
+
